{"version":1,"key":"card:145","content":{"id":145,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"IntersectionObserver","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以监听元素是否出现在视口中，其使用方法如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 创建 observer，接收两个参数\n// 1. fn，被监听的元素出现在视口中时触发的回调函数\n// 2. 创建 observer 的选项，包括 root, rootMargin 以及 threshold\nconst observer = new IntersectionObserver(fn, options);\n\n// 监听感兴趣的元素\nobserver.observe(element);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"47b1b54d-f1d0-4bca-8781-beaf73361668","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中回调函数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fn","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将会收到包含多个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"entry","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的数组（因为可以同时监听多个元素，使用统一的回调函数处理），每个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"entry","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包含如下属性："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"intersectionRatio","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：出现在视口中的元素与整体的比例"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/ratio_02835a36-f760-49b7-93b4-08fd96101537.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"boundingClientRect","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：元素的大小及位置信息"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/bounding-rect_182e8d29-4183-4575-b476-284c5183bdd8.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"intersectionRect","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：元素出现在视口中这部分的大小及位置信息"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"rootBounds","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"："},{"type":"formatted","text":"root","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的大小及位置信息"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：被监听的元素"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"time","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：自页面加载后，该事件发生的时间点，单位为毫秒"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"isIntersecting","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：是进入视口还是离开视口"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当被监听的元素进入或消失于视口中时，均会触发回调函数的执行，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"isIntersecting","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值可以表示是出现在视口中还是消失在视口中，当值为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，表示出现在视口中，为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"false","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示消失在视口中。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"options","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以设置如下字段："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"threshold","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：用来设置元素与视口相交的比例的阈值，一旦达到阈值，便会触发回调函数，它的值是一个数字或一个数组，默认是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即元素一出现在视口中就执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"root","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：我们不止可以监听元素在视口中出现与消失，在任意可滚动的元素中均可以监听，我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"root","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来指定滚动的容器，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"root","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的默认值为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"null","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当值为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"null","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"document","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作为滚动容器"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"rootMargin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：可以增大或缩小视口的区域，与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"margin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性的取值相似，不过这里的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rootMargin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还可以为负值"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"observe","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法来开始监听元素，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"unobserve","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来取消监听"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"\nobserver.observe(element);\nobserver.unobserve(element);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"c1fb91de-913e-4660-8065-61ad2e6d7b63","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["DOM/Intersection Observer"],"createTime":1690118424899,"updateTime":1743303640404,"linkedCards":[{"id":146,"target":{"key":"card:146","type":"card","id":146},"summary":"使用 IntersectionObserver 进行图片的懒加载。我们监控文档中所有的图片，这些图片的地址都设置在 data-src 上，当图片出现在视口中时，我们从 data-src 中取出地址，设置在 src 属性上，从而实现页面的懒加...","tags":["DOM/Intersection Observer"]},{"id":147,"target":{"key":"card:147","type":"card","id":147},"summary":"使用 Insersection Observer 实现无限滚动。在列表的最后一项，放置一个元素，这个元素透明不可见，我们监听这个元素是否出现视口，如果出现在视口中，就说明滚动到底部，我们便请求新的数据，我们可以设置 rootMargin ，...","tags":["DOM/Intersection Observer/技巧","技巧/Intersection Observer"]},{"id":153,"target":{"key":"card:153","type":"card","id":153},"summary":"同一个 MutationObserver 可以同时监听多个元素，可通过 disconnect 取消所有元素的监听。 <div id=\"text1\" contenteditable=\"true\">Hello World!</div> <div...","tags":["DOM/Mutation Observer"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640404}}